---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Luggage Delivery — Hands Free, Day Full"
  description="Why luggage delivery between the airport and your hotel works, when you need it, and how it works with Keepsmybag."
>
  <section class="container page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Practical Info</p>
    <h1>Spend your day with the city, not your suitcase.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The luggage delivery service we mention throughout the Istanbul Unpacked series moves
      your suitcase between the airport and your hotel (in either direction) with verified,
      insured couriers. Everything is tracked by QR code, so you get those hours back in the
      city instead.
    </p>

    <h2>When does it actually help?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You land early in the morning and your hotel check-in isn't until the afternoon.</li>
      <li>You've checked out but your flight isn't until evening — you want that "limbo" time back.</li>
      <li>You're splitting your stay (say, Europe side + Kadıköy) and don't want to haul a suitcase between hotels.</li>
      <li>You're staying in an Airbnb and your host has nowhere to store bags.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Alternatives</h2>
    <p>
      Hotel/Airbnb storage and airport left-luggage counters work too, but they tie you to one
      location. Delivery services let you keep your route one-way.
    </p>

    <div class="cta-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="cta-title">Keepsmybag</p>
        <p class="cta-desc">
          Verified, insured couriers, door-to-door between IST/SAW and your hotel, tracked by
          QR code the whole way.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.keepsmybag.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Book with Keepsmybag →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .cta-panel {
    background: var(--color-secondary-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-secondary);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  .cta-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .cta-desc {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    max-width: 40ch;
  }
</style>
